 r←Status(space folder args);verbose;noAPLnames;allUntracked
⍝ Desc: Reports all untracked files and/or all uncommitted changes
⍝ Parse: 1s -verbose -view -noAPLnames -allUntracked
⍝ Project: 1
 verbose←args.Switch'verbose'
 noAPLnames←args.Switch'noAPLnames'
 allUntracked←args.Switch'allUntracked'
 r←verbose noAPLnames allUntracked ##.Status folder
 :If args.view
     {{}(#.⎕NS'').(⎕ED⍠('ReadOnly' 1)&{'ed'}ed←⍵)}⍕(⎕UCS 13),¨↓r
     r←''
 :EndIf
⍝Done
